This trigger was running with an average prescale of 5 and average DAQ rate of 250 Hz, which allowed to collect in total about 560 M events corresponding to 14.2 pb\({}^{-1}\) of integrated luminosity. These data are spread over more than 1000 runs, which are the basic data units at STAR. Each run, on average, corresponds to 30 minutes of data-taking.

In some parts of the analysis also elastic proton-proton scattering data were used. These data were collected with RP_ET trigger defined as

