The relative values of the normalisation factors, \(F_{\pi\pi}^{\rm MC}/F_{KK}^{\rm MC}/F_{pp}^{\rm MC}\), remain in the following relation 1/1.01/0.88. Comparisons of the data with the fast MC predictions normalised according to the above prescription are shown in Fig. 9.18. Fast MC well reproduces measured spectra of \(\chi^{2}_{dE/dx}\) and \(m_{\rm TOF}^{2}\) for all selected particle pair species.

