In order to demonstrate a good understanding of the backgrounds, it is desirable to compare data and MC predictions. The checks have been done for the exclusive \(\pi^{+}\pi^{-}\) channel only2 and taking into account the non-exclusive background contribution as the contribution from the particle misidentification is negligible.

